      "trackName": "Katana Fruit - Watch Game",
      "description": "Katana Fruit Watch Game is a fast arcade slicing game designed for  Watch.\n\nSwipe to cut flying fruits, avoid dangerous bombs, and build combo streaks for higher scores. The controls are simple and responsive, making it easy to play in short sessions anytime.\n\nFeatures:\n\nSmooth swipe-to-slice gameplay\nCombo system for bonus points\nBomb hazards for high-risk moments\nHigh-score challenge and replayable rounds\nOptimized for  Watch performance\nIf you enjoy quick reaction games, fruit slicing, and score-chasing arcade action, Katana Fruit Watch Game is made for you.",
